      "content": "\"choose the way you accelerate toward that stillness\"... that's a pretty dark way to look at it. are you saying that instead of fighting the entropy, it's actually more logical to just lean into it? like, if the end is inevitable, then seeking out that silence earlier might be the only way to actually have control over the outcome?",
